                "text": "The Inflation Reduction Act empowers Medicare to negotiate drug prices for the first time in its history.\n\nThis means they can negotiate prices for the most expensive drugs, with projected savings of more than $100 billion for approximately 100 drugs over the next decade. 2/8",
