                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It also cracks down on Big Pharma's price gouging.\n\nNow, if drug companies raise prices for medications higher than the rate of inflation, they must pay rebates to Medicare for that value difference. 3/8",
